{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "title": "OpenHack Business Metrics",
  "description": "Hackathon KPIs: registrations, team formation, project submissions, judging progress, voting. NOTE: Business metrics (auth_registrations_total, core_teams_created_total, etc.) require code changes to emit. Current panels show HTTP proxy metrics.",
  "tags": ["openhack", "business"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 16,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "User Registrations",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "auth_registrations_total",
          "legendFormat": "Total Registrations",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Registration Rate (Last Hour)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(auth_registrations_total[1h]) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "Registrations/hr",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Teams Created",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "core_teams_created_total",
          "legendFormat": "Total Teams",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Avg Team Size",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "core_teams_created_total > 0",
          "legendFormat": "Avg Members",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Project Submissions Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "core_projects_submitted_total",
          "legendFormat": "Projects Submitted",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Judging Progress",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "judging_scores_submitted_total / judging_assignments_created_total * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Completion %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "blue", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Voting Activity",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(leaderboard_votes_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Votes/sec",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "VPS"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Total Votes Cast",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "leaderboard_votes_total",
          "legendFormat": "Total Votes",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "HTTP Request Rate by Service",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(http_requests_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "description": "Proxy metric - shows HTTP traffic while business metrics are being implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "HTTP Error Rate by Service",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(http_requests_failed[5m]) / rate(http_requests_total[5m]) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "Proxy metric - shows HTTP errors while business metrics are being implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Slowest Services (p99 Latency)",
      "type": "barchart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, service))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "description": "Proxy metric - shows latency while business metrics are being implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Implementation Notes",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
      "options": {
        "content": "### Business Metrics Implementation Required\n\nThe following metrics need to be added to the Rust services:\n\n| Service | Metrics Needed |\n|---------|----------------|\n| auth-svc | `auth_registrations_total`, `auth_logins_total`, `auth_login_failures_total`, `auth_jwt_issued_total` |\n| core-svc | `core_teams_created_total`, `core_projects_submitted_total`, `core_event_rsvps_total` |\n| judging-svc | `judging_scores_submitted_total`, `judging_assignments_completed_total`, `judging_assignments_created_total` |\n| leaderboard-svc | `leaderboard_votes_total`, `leaderboard_rankings_updated_total` |\n\nSee `openhack-common/src/metrics.rs` for the pattern to add custom counters.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    }
  ]
}
